#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:670
msgid "Copy Term with Metadata"
msgstr "Kopiraj izraz z metadata"

#: dist/simple-tags/includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:675
#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:675
msgid "To Copy terms with their metadata, please upgrade to pro."
msgstr "Za kopiranje izrazov z njihovimi metapodatki, prosimo nadgradite na pro."

#: dist/simple-tags/includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:676
#: includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:676
msgid ""
"With PublishPress Taxonomies Pro, you can duplicate taxonomy terms along "
"with all their metadata. This includes term descriptions, images, and "
"custom fields. You can copy terms between taxonomies to maintain consistent "
"organization across your site."
msgstr ""
"S PublishPress Taxonomies Pro lahko podvojite izraze taksonomije skupaj z "
"vsemi njihovimi metapodatki. To vključuje opise izrazov, slike in "
"prilagojena polja. Izraze lahko kopirate med taksonomijami, da ohranite "
"dosledno organizacijo po vaši strani."

#: dist/simple-tags/includes-core/TaxopressCoreAdmin.php:723
